k out a Burlesque show on our last night in Nola, and I'm so glad we found this little gem of a place. Easy to find, awesome space, and sultry atmosphere. I'll admit we thought the bar was going to be bigger since there was going to be a Burlesque show, but the space definitely worked with the amount of people that showed up. Drinks are on the pricier side, but are very well done. We ordered two rounds of drinks, and nothing disappointed us. Bartenders are awesome and friendly. The crowd wa..."},{"business_id":"ZL0Iyn8hlTHDz70-IPFBAQ","review_id":"PQkN51n31ecl2WDMzjeYJg","date":"2018-06-26T21:22:51","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9164645671844482,"text_excerpt":"Very neat little bar in the hotel. The decor is eclectic & gives off such a quirky but chill vibe (HUGE chairs, angel winged decor, etc)! We accidentally saw this place as we were walking towards the French Quarter from the Saenger Theatre on a Thursday night. Service was quick & there was live music!! Wasn't too crowded but there was definitely some life going on. Totally recommend to pause & check this place out as a little pit stop. Really neat."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"ZL0Iyn8hlTHDz70-IPFBAQ","photo_id":"t5rJiiGxkELxnihLnpGqbw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/t5rJiiGxkELxnihLnpGqbw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9303971529006958},{"business_id":"ZL0Iyn8hlTHDz70-IPFBAQ","photo_id":"6zN441OQjiLb_wIjEKGHNg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/6zN441OQjiLb_wIjEKGHNg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9102337956428528},{"business_id":"ZL0Iyn8hlTHDz70-IPFBAQ","photo_id":"Y850WOVndrnsm876kb71Gw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Y850WOVndrnsm876kb71Gw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9005264639854431},{"business_id":"ZL0Iyn8hlTHDz70-IPFBAQ","photo_id":"tA8Ujy0SWHxoRGIDOnmoTQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/tA8Ujy0SWHxoRGIDOnmoTQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8870491981506348},{"business_id":"ZL0Iyn8hlTHDz70-IPFBAQ","photo_id":"_5kY_LX8TxbZaGhc8K7p3Q","label":"inside","im